<title>USA: BOXING-QUARTAY RETAINS WBA WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-QUARTAY RETAINS WBA WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ike Quartay of Ghana retained his World Boxing Association welterweight title on a majority decision over Oba Carr of the United States on Friday.</p>
</text>
